			mes "[Priestess Panno]";
			mes "Fine. You really";
			mes "want to exchange your";
			mes "Lottery Tickets? It's my job";
			mes "to ask and make sure, you";
			mes "know, in case you were saving";
			mes "them for some weird reason.";
